
# Functions

## InitCity

Bootstrap city subsystems and reset open alert counters on startup.

- Decomposition: WarmSensors

## DispatchAlert

Record a sensor alert and enqueue it for downstream handling.

- Inputs: sensor (nat), level (nat)
- Outputs: ticket (nat)
- Decomposition: HandleAlert

## RegisterCitizen

Register a verified citizen into the city population set.

- Inputs: citizen (nat)
- Outputs: ok (nat)

# Data Resources

## SensorId

Natural-number identifier of a city sensor.

## ZoneId

Natural-number identifier of a city zone.

## sensors

Set of installed sensor identifiers.

## open_alerts

Count of alerts still waiting for handling.

# Constraints

## Positive sensors and alerts

forall[s: sensors] | s > 0 and open_alerts >= 0
